# ── Local development needs NO configuration ──────────────────────────────
# Just run `npm run dev`: the app uses an embedded database (PGlite,
# files in ./.pglite), creates the tables and seeds the catalog
# automatically on first boot.
#
# Optional — use an external PostgreSQL instead (Neon, Supabase, ...).
# DATABASE_URL is only honoured when it points to a REMOTE host;
# localhost URLs are ignored in favour of the embedded database.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host.neon.tech/db?sslmode=require
#
# 32+ byte random secret used to HMAC-sign session cookies.
# Generate one with:  openssl rand -hex 32
# Required in production. In local dev a temporary secret is
# auto-generated when this is missing, but carts reset on restart.
SESSION_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-secret
